                  <td valign="top"  >
                     <p class="normal">1.</p>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="top"  >
                     <span>Page 65, à l’article 64, paragraphe 10, phrase introductive:</span>
                  </td>
               </tr>
            </tbody>
         </table>
         <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
            <col width="20%"/>
            <col width="80%"/>
            <tbody>
               <tr>
                  <td valign="top"  >
                     <p class="oj-normal">
                        <span class="oj-italic">au lieu de:</span>
                     </p>
                  </td>
                  <td valign="top"  >
                     <div>
                        <p class="oj-normal">«Par dérogation aux paragraphes 3 à 9, les amendes administratives visées auxdits paragraphes ne s’appliquent pas:»</p>
                     </div>,</td>
               </tr>
            </tbody>
         </table>
